# iCloud sync artifacts. iCloud duplicates files as "name 2.ext" and leaves
# .icloud placeholders; three of these were committed by accident once.
# Note the second pattern also ignores any file you deliberately name
# "something 2.ext", so rename rather than fight it.
*.icloud
* [0-9].*
